      "message": "This assumes that all board ID signals share the same GPIO controller.  This also assumes that `defer_until_s5` is true.\n\nReplace this with a check that RVP ID is ready.  You can add a static bool that gets initialized to true once `pca95xx_deferred_init_cb` runs.",
