        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-07T16:45:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should only call `device_init()` if the GPIO controller has enabled `zephyr,deferred-init`.\n\nIf `defer_until_s5` is false, then you shouldn\u0027t need to call `device_init()` at all.  If the GPIO controller isn\u0027t ready and `defer_until_s5` is false, then there is an initialization ordering problem that should be fixed.\n\nThe other possible issue is that someone is calling `get_rvp_id_config()` before the `AP_POWER_STATE_S5` callback runs.",
      "parentUuid": "a3728300_7bfc516d",
